Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:06.22,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And win number six in main draws on the WTA Tour comes to Wang Xiyu{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N王曦雨拿下巡回赛正赛第{\fs78}6{\fs68}胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:11.36,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she handles her friend efficiently and effectively from start to finish.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N面对好友 她全程干净利落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.45,0:00:15.19,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王曦雨{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} 淘汰了王欣瑜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:17.15,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}12{\fs68}号晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.15,0:00:20.95,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}武汉网球公开赛首轮 一场中国德比
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.74,0:00:25.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And there it is.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就是这一球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.39,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}平分之后 王曦雨拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.39,0:00:31.11,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}在底线和对手来回相持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:33.88,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Xiyu sees her way to the early break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N王曦雨很早就破了发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:37.16,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Needs three tries, but gets the job done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N用了三次机会 还是拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:39.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} 轮到自己发球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:41.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}对手马上拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:43.43,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王曦雨在底线左右跑动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.43,0:00:45.30,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}把这一分的相持顶了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:47.33,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}随后保住发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.45,0:00:51.55,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王曦雨是左手持拍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:53.13,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这一分她左右调动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:55.13,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}先把王欣瑜拉到一侧边线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.13,0:00:57.73,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}再把球打向另一侧的空当
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:01:02.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's a perfect point executed by the lefty.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位左手将打出了完美的一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:05.08,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 又是王欣瑜的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.08,0:01:06.89,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这一分是底线相持
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.89,0:01:09.25,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王曦雨从正手位追到反手位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.25,0:01:12.08,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}再回到中路 一拍一拍接住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.47,0:01:16.07,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So Xiyu starts to take over here, trying to find another break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N王曦雨开始掌控局面 想再破一次发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:19.93,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}15{\fs68} 王曦雨又拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.57,0:01:24.57,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And there's the break. A double-break lead.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N破发成功 领先两个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:26.87,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 轮到王曦雨发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.87,0:01:28.41,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第一盘的盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:32.44,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她在远端 把王欣瑜从左边调到右边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.99,0:01:36.75,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the opening set is done in forty-three minutes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第一盘只用了{\fs78}43{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:41.27,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Wang Xiyu sees her way to a one-set advantage in the opening round{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N王曦雨在首轮先拿下一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.27,0:01:45.23,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}on night one of the Dongfeng Voyah Wuhan Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是武汉网球公开赛的开幕夜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:52.82,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, overall in this set, it's definitely the amount of unforced errors, really, from Xinyu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这盘王欣瑜非受迫性失误太多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:55.28,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二盘 王曦雨{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:56.78,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}在远端发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:58.77,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她把王欣瑜从左侧底角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:02:01.23,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}一路调动到右侧边线外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.23,0:02:04.41,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这一盘 王欣瑜一局都没拿到
