Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.27,0:02:08.26,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}一个也没有兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.65,0:02:17.41,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} {\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} 赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.41,0:02:19.65,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王欣瑜把她拉到正手位外角
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.65,0:02:21.54,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这一分救了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:37.32,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And win number six in main draws on the WTA Tour comes to Wang Xiyu{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N王曦雨拿下巡回赛正赛第{\fs78}6{\fs68}胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:42.46,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she handles her friend efficiently and effectively from start to finish.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N面对好友 她全程干净利落
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:48.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Wang Xinyu will be sent packing, experiencing her 16th career bagel.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N王欣瑜出局 生涯第{\fs78}16{\fs68}次被剃光头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:51.74,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was not going to be her night, as it belongs to Xiyu,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今晚不属于她 属于王曦雨
